# Licensing

This repository uses separate licenses for source code and scientific/publication content.

- Source code (HTML, CSS and JavaScript): MIT License. See `LICENSE-CODE`.
- Original maps, documentation, explanatory text and other non-code content
  authored for the Wetlands Map MG project: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
  International (CC BY 4.0). See `LICENSE-CONTENT.md`.
- Third-party datasets, basemaps and external materials retain their original
  licenses, terms and attribution requirements.

The definitive scientific citation for the wetland mapping product will be
added after publication of the corresponding thesis and/or journal article.
